sn36.6:1.21 starts: When he does not understand these things,
sn36.6:3.14 starts: Since he understands these things,
sn36.6:5.4 starts: Towards the undesired he has no aversion.
sn36.6:6.1 starts: For him attraction and repulsion no more exist;
an10.29:2.2 starts: In that thousandfold world system there are a thousand moons,
